Description: RISC OS on Linux's own parts of HardDisc4
 The RISC OS side of RISC OS on Linux, in HardDisc4: the Updates and
 Linux network Configure plug-ins, the hard disc icon (DiscIcon), and the
 LinuxShell (*Linux) and USBDriver modules. Your own files and choices
 are never touched.
